"The true Sylthaeryn Feirelle is dead."
"The true Sylthaeryn had bonded Syl the slime as her companion."
"Sylthaeryn used [Order] through the bond to make Syl kill her, the gravest elven taboo."
"When Sylthaeryn died her leaf fell, and her legacy Emblem passed toward Syl."
